<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">CRIMINAL ENTERPRISE / <%= zone.label.replace(' Crimes','') %></div><h1>Know your hustle.</h1><p>Choose your approach. Build a specialty. Know when to let the heat cool.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/city#daily">Daily objectives →</a></div>
<div class="crime-resources dashboard-panel"><div><span>NERVE</span><strong id="crimeNerve"><%= user.nerve %> / <%= user.max_nerve %></strong><small>+1 every 3 minutes</small></div><div><span>STAMINA</span><strong id="crimeStam"><%= user.stamina %>%</strong><small>+1% every 5 minutes</small></div><div><span>SPEED</span><strong id="crimeSpeed"><%= user.speed %></strong><small>Every 50 speed lowers catch risk by 5 points</small></div></div>
<section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Your criminal standing</h2><span class="small-badge" id="criminalBonus">+<%= user.criminal.nerveBonus %> NERVE CAPACITY</span></div><strong id="criminalExperience"><%= user.criminal.xp %> criminal experience</strong><div class="progress-track"><span id="criminalProgressBar" style="width:<%= user.criminal.progress %>%"></span></div><p class="panel-intro" id="criminalNext"><%= user.criminal.nextAt ? `${user.criminal.nextAt-user.criminal.xp} experience to your next nerve point.` : 'Maximum criminal nerve bonus earned.' %></p><p class="subtle">Successful crimes grant experience equal to their nerve cost. Every 100 experience adds 1 to your nerve cap, up to 25 extra. Getting caught grants no experience. Existing level and property bonuses still apply.</p></section>
<section class="dashboard-panel heat-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Police heat <span id="crimeHeat"><%= user.heat %></span><small> / 100</small></h2><a class="text-link" href="/education">Study streetcraft →</a></div><div class="progress-track"><span id="heatBar" style="width:<%= user.heat %>%"></span></div><p class="panel-intro">Every 5 heat adds 1 point to catch risk. Heat falls by 1 each minute, even offline. Getting caught adds another 10 heat. Try training or studying between scores.</p><fieldset class="approach-choices"><legend>Your approach</legend><% APPROACHES.forEach(a=>{ %><label><input type="radio" name="approach" value="<%= a.key %>" <%= a.key==='balanced' ? 'checked' : '' %>><strong><%= a.name %></strong><small><%= a.desc %></small></label><% }); %></fieldset></section>
<div id="crimeRecovery" class="status-warning" <%= user.in_jail || user.in_hospital ? '' : 'hidden' %>><span id="crimeRestriction"><%= user.in_jail ? 'You are in jail.' : user.in_hospital ? 'You are in the hospital.' : '' %></span> <a id="crimeRecoveryLink" href="<%= user.in_jail ? '/jail' : '/hospital' %>">View recovery →</a><span id="crimeJailTimer"></span></div>
<div id="crimeMsg" class="game-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<div class="crime-cards">
<% zone.crimes.forEach((crime,index) => { const skill=mastery[crime.key]; %>
<article class="crime-card" id="crime-<%= crime.key %>"><div class="crime-card-heading"><span class="activity-number">0<%= index + 1 %> /</span><span class="small-badge">MASTERY <b class="mastery-level"><%= skill.level %></b> / 10</span></div><h2><%= crime.name %></h2><p class="crime-description"><%= crime.desc %></p>
  <div class="crime-payout"><span>CASH REWARD</span><strong class="crime-cash">$<%= Math.floor(crime.cash[0] * (1 + skill.rewardBonus / 100)).toLocaleString() %>–$<%= Math.floor(crime.cash[1] * (1 + skill.rewardBonus / 100)).toLocaleString() %></strong><small><%= crime.xp %> XP · <%= crime.rep %> reputation on success</small></div>
  <div class="crime-costs"><span><b><%= crime.nerve %></b> nerve</span><span><b><%= crime.stamina %>%</b> stamina</span><span><b class="crime-risk"><%= skill.catchChance %>%</b> catch risk</span></div>
  <div class="crime-mastery"><div><strong>Practice pays off</strong><span class="mastery-successes"><%= skill.successes %> successes</span></div><div class="progress-track"><span class="mastery-bar" style="width:<%= skill.progress %>%"></span></div><small class="mastery-next"><%= skill.nextSuccesses ? `${skill.nextSuccesses} successes to the next mastery level` : 'Maximum mastery reached' %></small><small class="mastery-bonus">+<%= skill.rewardBonus %>% cash · −<%= skill.riskReduction %> points catch risk</small></div>
  <button class="action-button commit-button" data-crime="<%= crime.key %>" <%= user.in_jail || user.in_hospital || user.nerve < crime.nerve || user.stamina < crime.stamina ? 'disabled' : '' %>>Commit crime ↗</button>
</article>
<% }); %>
</div>
<section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Build a specialty</h2><span class="small-badge">THE LONG GAME</span></div><p class="panel-intro">Every 10 successful attempts unlocks another mastery level, up to level 10: +2% cash and −1 percentage point catch risk per level. Speed and education reduce risk; approaches and heat also affect it. Catch risk stays between 5% and 90%. Getting caught still costs nerve and stamina and sends you to jail. Every valid attempt counts toward your daily objective.</p><a class="text-link" href="/gym">Train speed to improve your odds →</a></section>
<section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Bigger scores await</h2><a class="text-link" href="/relocate">City transfers →</a></div><div class="crime-destinations"><% Object.values(CRIME_ZONES).filter(z=>!z.prison_ids.includes(user.prison_id||1)).forEach(z=>{ const destination=PRISONS.find(p=>p.id===z.prison_ids[0]); %><a href="/relocate"><strong><%= destination.short %></strong><small>Level <%= destination.level_req %> · <%= z.crimes.length %> crimes</small></a><% }); %></div></section>
<script type="application/json" id="crimeState"><%- JSON.stringify({ user:{ nerve:user.nerve,max_nerve:user.max_nerve,stamina:user.stamina,speed:user.speed,heat:user.heat,perks:user.perks,criminal:user.criminal,in_jail:user.in_jail,in_hospital:user.in_hospital,jail_until:user.jail_until }, crimes:zone.crimes, mastery, approaches:APPROACHES }) %></script>
<script src="/js/crimes.js" defer></script>
